  "body": "from: https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#definitions-2\n\n> A settings object\n> \n> ```\n> An environment settings object, containing various settings that are shared with other scripts in the same context\\.\n> ```\n\ndoes that mean to say that the term `settings object` is by definition equivalent to the term `environment settings object` ?   \n\nor does it mean to say that a `settings object` contains an `environment settings object` ?\n",
